	TAD GATHBF+1
	SZA CLA		/CHARS 3 AND 4 MUST NOT EXIST
	JMP MACX0	/ASSUME TO BE MACRO NAME
	TAD (IFL1-1
	DCA XR11	/POINT TO IF-TYPES
IF1,	TAD I XR11
	SNA		/END OF LIST?
